answers = "Whether K7 (RMS norm scale pair) and K10 (batched top-k) still pay for themselves at the served J5q np2 profile on stack11-s2. Round trace is ON in both arms; absolute ms/round are comparable only within this item. The owner decides the drop; this item only prices it."

